{"unit_id":"tag:06F7:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>设<MATH_0001>是代数空间（algebraic spaces）的态射（morphisms）的一个性质。短语“<MATH_0002>是光滑（smooth）源和目标局部的（local on the source and target）”有直观的含义。然而，这个概念并不等同于要求<MATH_0003>既是光滑（smooth）源局部的（local on the source），又是光滑（smooth）目标局部的（local on the target）。我们已在《下降（Descent）》的节<REF_0001>中详细讨论过类似现象（对于平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）拓扑（topology）和概形（schemes）的范畴（category））（快速概览可看《下降（Descent）》的注记<REF_0002>）。然而，光滑（smooth）和平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）拓扑（topology）两种情形之间有一个重要区别。为了解这一点，我们建议读者思考《下降（Descent）》的引理<REF_0003>与引理<REF_0004>的区别，以及《下降（Descent）》的引理<REF_0005>与引理<REF_0006>的区别。确切地说，在平展（<ACCENT_0003>tale）情形下，目标的平展（<ACCENT_0004>tale）“覆盖（covering）”的选择无关紧要，而在光滑（smooth）情形下则不然。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑"},{"source_term":"local on the source and target","target_term":"源和目标局部的"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑"},{"source_term":"local on the source","target_term":"源局部的"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑"},{"source_term":"local on the target","target_term":"目标局部的"},{"source_term":"Descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"Descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0002>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"Descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"Descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0003>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0004>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"对象，待决。"},{"source_term":"morphisms"