{"unit_id":"tag:06F8:statement","translation":"设<MATH_0001>是一个概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0002>是一个态射（morphisms）性质，这些态射的源和目标为<MATH_0003>上的代数空间（algebraic spaces）。我们称<MATH_0004>是<TEXTITOPEN_0001>源和目标光滑局部的（smooth local on source-and-target）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，如果<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> （在预复合（precomposing）光滑（smooth）映射（maps）下稳定）若<MATH_0005>是光滑的（smooth），且<MATH_0006>具有<MATH_0007>，则<MATH_0008>具有<MATH_0009>，\n<STRUCT_0003> （在光滑（smooth）基底变换（base change）下稳定）若<MATH_0010>具有<MATH_0011>，且<MATH_0012>是光滑的（smooth），则基底变换（base change）<MATH_0013>具有<MATH_0014>，以及\n<STRUCT_0004> （局部性（locality））给定一个态射（morphism）<MATH_0015>，以下条件等价（equivalent）<STRUCT_0005>\n<STRUCT_0006> <MATH_0016>具有<MATH_0017>，\n<STRUCT_0007> 对每个<MATH_0018>，存在一个交换图（commutative diagram）<MATH_0019>，其竖直箭头（vertical arrows）是光滑的（smooth），并存在<MATH_0020>及<MATH_0021>，使得<MATH_0022>具有<MATH_0023>。\n<STRUCT_0008>\n<STRUCT_0009>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"smooth local on source-and-target","target_term":"源和目标光滑局部的"},{"source_term":"precomposing","target_term":"预复合"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑的"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基底变换"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑的"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基底变换"},{"source_term":"locality","target_term":"局部性"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价"},{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图"},{"source_term":"vertical arrows","target_term":"竖直箭头"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑的"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"scheme","target_term":"概形","context":"对象，待决。"},{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"映射，待决。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数